Transitions for author inline declarations: Element::SetInlineProperty and the style
attribute start the transitions the after-change list covers from the current value, a
transition ending at an inline declaration restores it instead of removing it, the after-change
style of class changes keeps inline declarations, and a running transition already ending at
the after-change value continues (CSS Transitions 1 §3).

